**13.86K𝞃** ($2.73M) __(#84)__  | FDV: **$24.82M**\",\"conviction\":100.0,\"direction\":\"up\",\"netuid\":100,\"subnet_name\":\"Cortex\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-15T11:10:58+00:00\",\"skin_type\":null,\"skin_amount\":null,\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/219857\"},{\"id\":3919,\"author_name\":\"Taoser\",\"author_username\":\"@taoser\",\"content\":\"And yet they received 100’s of millions in emissions and cant be profitable. Idk tao holders seem to be happy funding stuff for ever with 0 value returned to them\",\"conviction\":100.0,\"direction\":\"up\",\"netuid\":null,\"subnet_name\":null,\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-17T07:32:30+00:00\",\"skin_type\":null,\"skin_amount\":null,\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220039\"},{\"id\":4051,\"author_name\":\"Cicada\",\"author_username\":\"@vladartjomov\",\"content\":\"[**OxMarkets**](https://www.0xmarkets.io/) | Discord: https://0xmarkets.io/discord | [GitHub](https://github.com/General-Tao-Ventures/cartha-validator) | contact@0xmarkets.io\\n__Liquidity-as-a-Service subnet powering 0xMarkets - a permissionless perp DEX for FX, crypto, and commodities. Deposit USDC. Earn Spread + Fees + Alpha.\\n____https://x.com/0x_Markets__\\nEmission: **0.0000465𝞃** __(#63)__ | Root: **14.42%** | ADR: **80.08%**\\nPool: **6971.95𝞃** vs **3.00Mα** | Circ: **27.46%** | FDV: **$9.50M**\\nMCap: **13.39K𝞃** ($2.61M) __(#88)__ | Dereg refund: **0.0029𝞃** (+24.88%)\\nDereg rank: **#9**\\nPrice: **0.00232𝞃** | 1h: **-0.00%** | 24h: **-1.69%** | 1w: **-14.66%**\",\"conviction\":100.0,\"direction\":\"neutral\",\"netuid\":null,\"subnet_name\":null,\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-17T11:55:11+00:00\",\"skin_type\":null,\"skin_amount\":null,\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220175\"},{\"id\":4548,\"author_name\":\"nardiel\",\"author_username\":null,\"content\":\"I'm not sure about Leadpoet, but Redteam claims they're already profitable while only doing buybacks of like 1 or 2 TAO at a time. And it looks like they haven't even been doing that lately, so you might want to check on that.\",\"conviction\":100.0,\"direction\":\"up\",\"netuid\":null,\"subnet_name\":null,\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-19T01:00:19+00:00\",\"skin_type\":null,\"skin_amount\":null,\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220691\"},{\"id\":4184,\"author_name\":\"Cicada\",\"author_username\":\"@vladartjomov\",\"content\":\"1) Avg trading volume and number of unique active traders on the beta (since launch)?\\n\\n2) What's the real organic trading-fee revenue per week, in USD, separate from emissions?\\n\\n3) How many positions have actually been opened at high leverage vs the 500x headline?\\n\\n~~4) What portion of the 43.7% APY is trading fees vs alpha emissions? What’s the split?~~\\n\\n5) What does LP APY look like with emissions stripped out?\\n\\n6) When emissions taper, what's the plan to keep LPs from fleeing?\\n\\n7) Who eats the loss when a leveraged position wins big - the LP vault? What's the max drawdown an LP can suffer in one event?\\n\\n8) Any circuit breakers / oracle protections against wick liquidation hunts?\\n\\n9) Oracle source for pricing - and what stops manipulation on thin markets?\\n\\n10) Why zero commits in over a month while claiming a live quality beta? Where's the work happening?\\n\\n11) Is the core repo private now? If so, why - and what verifiable output can you show?\\n\\n12) What's the runway - can the subnet survive if it deregs and emissions stop? Or are there alternatives options in case the approach won’t be sustainable (e.g a pivot)\\n\\n13) Is there a roadmap with dated milestones for the future? (If there is, you can just state discord / twitter / docs, I will find it on my own)\\n\\n14) Name one thing this does that Hyperliquid / existing perp DEXs don't. Concretely.\\n\\n15) Why build a perp DEX on a subnet at all vs its own L1/L2 - what does Bittensor add? What’s the purpose / role of the miners and validators on the subnet?\\n\\nThank you 🙏\",\"conviction\":99.41,\"direction\":\"up\",\"netuid\":null,\"subnet_name\":null,\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-17T13:19:36+00:00\",\"skin_type\":null,\"skin_amount\":null,\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220315\"}],\"telegram_proof\":{\"graded\":73,\"hits\":32,\"misses\":34,\"neutral\":7,\"hit_rate\":48.5,\"ready\":true,\"recent\":[{\"id\":4565,\"message_id\":4565,\"author_name\":\"Max\",\"author_handle\":\"@mxmsbt\",\"netuid\":44,\"subnet_name\":null,\"move_pct\":2.07,\"pump_pct_max\":2.07,\"status\":\"hit\",\"hit\":true,\"content\":\"we made sure that from a legal perspective Manako has to buy its models and computer services from sn44\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-19T01:18:24+00:00\",\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220708\"},{\"id\":4561,\"message_id\":4561,\"author_name\":\"Max\",\"author_handle\":\"@mxmsbt\",\"netuid\":44,\"subnet_name\":null,\"move_pct\":2.07,\"pump_pct_max\":2.07,\"status\":\"hit\",\"hit\":true,\"content\":\"and when i say \\\"score\\\" i mean sn44 buy back and burn\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-19T01:14:26+00:00\",\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220704\"},{\"id\":4495,\"message_id\":4495,\"author_name\":\"[τ]𝚛αnsҡiҡΣ\",\"author_handle\":\"@TransKike\",\"netuid\":null,\"subnet_name\":null,\"move_pct\":8.82,\"pump_pct_max\":8.82,\"status\":\"miss\",\"hit\":false,\"content\":\"What do people mean saying stuff like this. What can be easier than getting a wallet an connecting it to a website?\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-18T21:22:20+00:00\",\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220638\"},{\"id\":4493,\"message_id\":4493,\"author_name\":\"Cicada\",\"author_handle\":\"@vladartjomov\",\"netuid\":15,\"subnet_name\":null,\"move_pct\":-14.44,\"pump_pct_max\":-14.44,\"status\":\"miss\",\"hit\":false,\"content\":\"💸🖥️**Large SN15: ORO alpha transfer:** \\n**2921.42𝞃** ($556.82K) in [8874275-0008](https://taostats.io/extrinsic/8874275-0008)\\n[🧬5HDD..MNC3](https://taostats.io/account/5HDDvwGu1fyrgU8Xq3usxgWAdMPbR12y1epM