30,"mimeType":"application/json","compression":7353,"text":"{\"status\":\"success\",\"days\":30,\"minimum_sample\":5,\"count\":36,\"callers\":[{\"author_id\":\"id:836503228\",\"author_name\":\"Cicada\",\"author_username\":\"@vladartjomov\",\"hits\":8,\"misses\":4,\"neutral\":0,\"sample_size\":12,\"recent\":[{\"message_id\":4493,\"content\":\"💸🖥️**Large SN15: ORO alpha transfer:** \\n**2921.42𝞃** ($556.82K) in [8874275-0008](https://taostats.io/extrinsic/8874275-0008)\\n[🧬5HDD..MNC3](https://taostats.io/account/5HDDvwGu1fyrgU8Xq3usxgWAdMPbR12y1epMvubrWYRRMNC3) → [🖥️SN15 ORO](https://taostats.io/account/5GMtrkkvybJiWpo5boj\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-18T21:21:14+00:00\",\"netuid\":15,\"proof\":{\"eligible\":true,\"status\":\"miss\",\"evaluation\":\"resolved\",\"direction\":\"flat\",\"move_pct\":-14.44,\"outcome\":\"dump\",\"threshold\":60.0},\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220636\"},{\"message_id\":4492,\"content\":\"I think they got their key compromised or something, right?\\n\\nWallet that funded the buyers wallet (2.5k ish tao) was topped up by Crucible’s wallet (pretty sure it’s their own wallet) and immediately bought sn15\\n\\nValidator, chart, transfer, everything points at that\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-18T21:20:41+00:00\",\"netuid\":15,\"proof\":{\"eligible\":true,\"status\":\"miss\",\"evaluation\":\"resolved\",\"direction\":\"flat\",\"move_pct\":-17.71,\"outcome\":\"dump\",\"threshold\":60.0},\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220635\"},{\"message_id\":4490,\"content\":\"Probably a buy back to recover whatever was stolen during an alleged hack previously\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-18T21:18:33+00:00\",\"netuid\":null,\"proof\":{\"eligible\":true,\"status\":\"hit\",\"evaluation\":\"resolved\",\"direction\":\"up\",\"move_pct\":8.71,\"outcome\":\"pump\",\"threshold\":60.0},\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220633\"}],\"accuracy\":66.7,\"qualified\":true,\"minimum_sample\":5},{\"author_id\":\"id:7915797706\",\"author_name\":\"KaWis\",\"author_username\":\"@Kawis_Leo\",\"hits\":5,\"misses\":4,\"neutral\":1,\"sample_size\":10,\"recent\":[{\"message_id\":4347,\"content\":\"Prometheon Opens Mining on Bittensor Subnet 108 with Lowered Entry Barrier \\n\\n🔉: https://x.com/i/status/2089706169300394393\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-18T17:48:09+00:00\",\"netuid\":null,\"proof\":{\"eligible\":true,\"status\":\"miss\",\"evaluation\":\"resolved\",\"direction\":\"flat\",\"move_pct\":2.95,\"outcome\":\"mild_pump\",\"threshold\":60.0},\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220484\"},{\"message_id\":4346,\"content\":\"Score Studio, from Bittensor Subnet 44 (@webuildscore), released real-time depth estimation combined with object detection and background removal tools, demonstrated in videos showing precise bounding boxes and confidence scores on a bird figure \\n\\n🔉: https://x.com/i/status/208971\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-18T17:47:02+00:00\",\"netuid\":44,\"proof\":{\"eligible\":true,\"status\":\"hit\",\"evaluation\":\"resolved\",\"direction\":\"flat\",\"move_pct\":1.25,\"outcome\":\"stable\",\"threshold\":60.0},\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220483\"},{\"message_id\":4342,\"content\":\"SynthdataCo(SN50) reports that Kalshi’s 15-minute BTC prediction market is increasingly leading short-term Bitcoin price moves on Binance and other centralised exchanges, with the predictive strength growing notably through 2026. \\n\\n🔉: https://x.com/i/status/2089743778135392482\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-18T17:44:22+00:00\",\"netuid\":50,\"proof\":{\"eligible\":true,\"status\":\"neutral\",\"evaluation\":\"resolved\",\"direction\":\"down\",\"move_pct\":1.48,\"outcome\":\"stable\",\"threshold\":60.0},\"source_url\":\"https://t.me/officialsubnetsummer/220479\"}],\"accuracy\":55.6,\"qualified\":true,\"minimum_sample\":5},{\"author_id\":\"id:8060802597\",\"author_name\":\"Tim\",\"author_username\":\"@timileyin_t\",\"hits\":2,\"misses\":3,\"neutral\":1,\"sample_size\":6,\"recent\":[{